    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) A day has 24 hours. The hours from midnight to noon are a.m. and from noon to midnight are p.m.\n7 a.m. is early morning and 7 p.m. is evening.\nIn 24-hour time, 7 p.m. is written 19:00.\nTo change p.m. to 24-hour time add 12."
    }
